; Klatt's duration rules 9 and 10. Four cards a segment in (kind, nextk, p1, pf); out, the factors that apply, in
; hundredths, then 0. Rule 9, a vowel: p1 when phrase-final, else 70 + 3 p1 / 10. Rule 10, a vowel: 120 before a
; vowel, 70 after one; a consonant: 50 between consonants, 70 next to one (a pause is neither).
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   kind     03-17: a segment; a pause has no factors
  04                    INP   nextk
  05                    INP   p1
  06                    INP   pf
  07                    CLA   kind
  08                    SUB   c8
  09                    TAC   sound
  10                    OUT   z
  11                    CLA   z
  12                    STO   pkind
  13                    JMP   rec
  14            sound   CLA   kind
  15                    SUB   n2
  16                    TAC   v9
  17                    JMP   c10
  18            v9      CLA   pf       18-44: a vowel: rules 9 and 10
  19                    SUB   00
  20                    TAC   np
  21                    OUT   p1
  22                    JMP   v10
  23            np      CLA   p1
  24                    ADD   p1
  25                    ADD   p1
  26                    SFT   01
  27                    ADD   c70
  28                    STO   t
  29                    OUT   t
  30            v10     CLA   nextk
  31                    SUB   00
  32                    TAC   v10b
  33                    SUB   00
  34                    TAC   o120
  35                    JMP   v10b
  36            o120    OUT   c120
  37            v10b    CLA   pkind
  38                    SUB   00
  39                    TAC   end
  40                    SUB   00
  41                    TAC   o70
  42                    JMP   end
  43            o70     OUT   c70
  44                    JMP   end
  45            c10     CLA   z        45-67: a consonant: t = consonants next to it
  46                    STO   t
  47                    CLA   pkind
  48                    SUB   n2
  49                    TAC   cn
  50                    CLA   00
  51                    STO   t
  52            cn      CLA   nextk
  53                    SUB   n2
  54                    TAC   cc
  55                    CLA   t
  56                    ADD   00
  57                    STO   t
  58            cc      CLA   t
  59                    SUB   00
  60                    TAC   end
  61                    SUB   00
  62                    TAC   o70
  63                    OUT   c50
  64            end     OUT   z
  65                    CLA   kind
  66                    STO   pkind
  67                    JMP   rec
  70            kind    DATA  0
  71            nextk   DATA  0
  72            p1      DATA  0
  73            pf      DATA  0
  74            pkind   DATA  0
  75            t       DATA  0
  76            z       DATA  0
  77            c8      DATA  8
  78            n2      DATA  2
  79            c70     DATA  70
  80            c120    DATA  120
  81            c50     DATA  50
